  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$f(x)=\\cos x+x \\sin x-1$\r\n$\\Rightarrow f^{\\prime}(x)=-\\sin x+\\sin x+x \\cos x>0 ; x \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$\r\n$\\Rightarrow f(x)$ is increasing function\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\Rightarrow f(x)>f(0) \\\\\r\n\\cos x+x \\sin x-1>0 \\\\\r\n\\cos x+x \\sin x>1\r\n\\end{array}$",
